#: kaccess.cpp:44
msgid ""
"The Shift key has been locked and is now active for all of the following "
"keypresses."
msgstr ""
"सिफ्ट कुञ्जीमा ताल्चा लगाइएको छ र अहिले निम्न कुञ्जी थिचाइहरूमा यो सक्रिय छ ।"

#: kaccess.cpp:45
msgid "The Shift key is now active."
msgstr "अहिले सिफ्टकुञ्जी सक्रिय छ ।"

#: kaccess.cpp:46
